  "notes": [
    "Same pin set as spike 05 (langgraph-durability). This harness is a sibling: mechanisms were copied and adapted, nothing is imported from it, and spike 05's frozen evidence is untouched.",
    "The LangGraph Store is the './store' subpath export of the checkpointer package; no second vendor package is involved.",
